  "Needs signing in again": ["Connexion à renouveler","Erneute Anmeldung erforderlich","Es necesario volver a iniciar sesión","È necessario accedere di nuovo","É necessário entrar novamente","Opnieuw inloggen vereist","Wymagane ponowne logowanie","Behöver logga in igen"],
