  "This playlist no longer exists. Please select another playlist.": ["Cette playlist n’existe plus. Sélectionnez-en une autre.","Diese Playlist existiert nicht mehr. Wähle eine andere Playlist.","Esta lista ya no existe. Selecciona otra.","Questa playlist non esiste più. Selezionane un’altra.","Esta playlist não existe mais. Selecione outra.","Deze afspeellijst bestaat niet meer. Kies een andere afspeellijst.","Ta playlista już nie istnieje. Wybierz inną playlistę.","Den här spellistan finns inte längre. Välj en annan spellista."],
  "Tyler, The Creator\nEarth, Wind & Fire": ["Tyler, The Creator\nEarth, Wind & Fire","Tyler, The Creator\nEarth, Wind & Fire","Tyler, The Creator\nEarth, Wind & Fire","Tyler, The Creator\nEarth, Wind & Fire","Tyler, The Creator\nEarth, Wind & Fire","Tyler, The Creator\nEarth, Wind & Fire","Tyler, The Creator\nEarth, Wind & Fire","Tyler, The Creator\nEarth, Wind & Fire"],
